                "All students passed. Every student passed. Each student got a certificate."
              ],
              [
                "both / either / neither",
                "о двух",
                "Both answers are right. Either day is fine. Neither option works."
              ],
              [
                "no / none (of)",
                "ни один",
                "No one came. None of my friends came."
              ],
              [
                "few / a few, little / a little",
                "мало / немного",
                "Few people know (почти никто). A few people know (несколько)."
              ]
            ]
          },
          "tip": "neither — с утвердительным глаголом: Neither of them is coming (не isn't). every / each + глагол в ед. ч.: Every student has a laptop."
